/-!
# `ff_aac_sbr_ctx_alloc_init`: the element as cells

Generated by `scripts/sbr/parse/init/foot.py`. The `ExtChannelElement` that `av_mallocz`
returns (0x88ba0 bytes at `p`; `sbr` at `p + 0x28920`) as cells in address order: the zero
runs and the cells the routine writes or hands to a callee (the fields of `EV`, byte lists).
`ElemS_x` brings the cell of field `x` to the front (`ElemH_x`: the other cells, which do not
depend on `v.x`); `zs_elemS` splits the zeroed block. `EV` and `ElemS` are in
`SessionSpec.lean` (`foot.py --spec`).
-/

